  "limitations": [
    "Shared M4 desktop; ordinary applications remained active. All samples retained, no build/test overlapped benchmark jobs.",
    "Performance measurements use orthorhombic SW+LJ and do not establish triclinic throughput or universal CPU parity.",
    "Short triclinic checks cover initial and one-step energy/force, not long-trajectory or external pressure equivalence. General non-upper-triangular cells and self-image multiplicity are direct unit-test coverage.",
    "EAM analytic ATV vs LAMMPS interpolation of identical parameters. SW+LJ is an artificial composition benchmark, not a fitted silicon potential.",
    "GPW/slab Ewald and some external-field components retain orthorhombic restrictions. PPPM distributed grids reject nonuniform cuts. CUDA is unvalidated.",
    "Baseline/final differences also include runtime cache and EAM boundary fixes; the paired comparison is not isolated to one source line."
  ],
